&lt;p&gt;Procurement Operations is the front door for buying at Anthropic. We sit inside Finance Operations and own the path from &quot;I need to buy something&quot; to a signed agreement, an accurate purchase order, and clean spend data at month end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Procurement Operations Business Partner to own that path for the teams that keep Anthropic&#39;s offices, people, and physical spaces running. Workplace covers real estate, office build outs and leases, furniture and equipment, facilities services, maintenance, and food and beverage. Security covers physical security: guard services, access control and badging, cameras, and security consulting that protect our offices and people. People covers recruiting agencies and recruiting operations, HR systems, benefits and Total Rewards vendors, and training and development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the person who makes all of it feel simple to the teams who depend on it and reliable to the Finance stakeholders behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high volume role with an accounting core. You ensure every purchase in your portfolio is coded, dated, received, and accrued correctly, so spend is right in the books every month. Expect a steady queue of requests, statements of work, change orders, and renewals, and expect to be the person Accounting trusts on all of it.&lt;/p&gt;
